      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Unit of change: shared context products.\n\u2022 Context map: trusted source, owner, freshness,\n   access boundary\n\u2022 Repository instructions, task briefs, curated\n   architecture material \u2014 versioned, not pasted\n\u2022 Context is a product with a lifecycle, not a\n   folder of documents\nFails as: stale context, confidently applied.",
      "originalText": "Unit of change: shared context products.\n\u2022 Context map: trusted source, owner, freshness,\n   access boundary\n\u2022 Repository instructions, task briefs, curated\n   architecture material \u2014 versioned, not pasted\n\u2022 Context is a product with a lifecycle, not a\n   folder of documents\nFails as: stale context, confidently applied.",
