      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 225526302,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1254591993,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sandboxed execution, small\ndiffs, separated propose /\napprove / execute, and a\nrehearsed rollback for every\nautomated path. Assume the\nloop will be wrong\nsome of the time.",
      "originalText": "Sandboxed execution, small\ndiffs, separated propose /\napprove / execute, and a\nrehearsed rollback for every\nautomated path. Assume the\nloop will be wrong\nsome of the time.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 94
    },
    {
      "id": "text-977b7c39",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1158,
      "width": 1251.6,
      "height": 35.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 887430058,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 293381774,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Governance is a design input. A control added after a workflow is automated is a control that was already bypassed.\nThe same four questions \u2014 what data, whose access, whose signature, what evidence \u2014 are asked at the first prompt and at the hundredth automated run.",
      "originalText": "Governance is a design input. A control added after a workflow is automated is a control that was already bypassed.\nThe same four questions \u2014 what data, whose access, whose signature, what evidence \u2014 are asked at the first prompt and at the hundredth automated run.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
